{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-22","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接四边形的对角互补","englishTitle":"The opposite angles of quadrilaterals in circles are equal to two right angles.","book":3,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","contentId":"euclid-3-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f691c725eff017f87b8b70ffedf426ede73513ca3335a88641e6cdc6ef8a106f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-22.statement","euclid-3-22.construction.1","euclid-3-22.construction.2","euclid-3-22.proof.1","euclid-3-22.proof.2","euclid-3-22.construction.3","euclid-3-22.proof.3","euclid-3-22.conclusion","euclid-3-22.historical.1","euclid-3-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b59a42ec1d82ec76025312ef97aa771d4ee651e1a9e3c75051e938827099904","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The opposite angles of quadrilaterals in circles are equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆形中四边形的反角等于2 直角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜内切界四边形每相对两角并与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于圆的内切四边形的每一对对角，等于两个直角，"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"92964c8bd139bf04031abf8075f14559aa51b775cf926c1a0371c6c29b0685dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be a circle, and let ABCD be a quadrilateral in it; I say that the opposite angles are equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD圆圈,让ABCD圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆圆"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4b4d20eb95c179ff34075cdcb9b71742ef00ea66512188c1b990a149e587173","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AC, BD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AC,BD连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e73f689008fc79d04a8f9448694d7592be3e468920c204b16bc8d18a6acb1cf","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since in any triangle the three angles are equal to two right angles, [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] the three angles CAB, ABC, BCA of the triangle ABC are equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"而在任何三角形中,三个角度等于两个直角, 三角形ABC中的三个角度CAB,ABC,BCA等于两个直角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"149078450a49a0022924f7b2b95bd33f573aa8f23b9182dc73a7fe349fcaa6b1","citations":["euclid-3-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle CAB is equal to the angle BDC, for they are in the same segment BADC; [[III. 21](/principles/euclid-3-21)] and the angle ACB is equal to the angle ADB, for they are in the same segment ADCB; therefore the whole angle ADC is equal to the angles BAC, ACB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CAB角度等于BDC角度,因为它们位于同一段BADC;ACB角度等于ADB角度,因为它们位于同一段ADCB;因此,整个ADC角度等于BAC、ACB角度。 [[III. 21](/principles/euclid-3-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a65377f258452e7def2334996b3ddbdce0bf7025fe7df5bd39b371dd39cb041","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle ABC be added to each; therefore the angles ABC, BAC, ACB are equal to the angles ABC, ADC. But the angles ABC, BAC, ACB are equal to two right angles; therefore the angles ABC, ADC are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将角度ABC加到每个角度; 因此角度ABC, BAC, ACB等于角度ABC, ADC。 但角度ABC, BAC, ACB等于两个角度直角; 因此角度ABC, ADC也等于角度2, 直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d70e1c5e82ba0e59475c1ef28d4b063ec015594fb031216c5b2bf38b4f11ea85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the angles BAD, DCB are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,BAD,DCB的角度也等于2,直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"349f1d62fcf3eae47cbdc43e38b1f1645285bb7f1d197619f9fe75589db9258f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜内切界四边形每相对两角并与两直角等解曰甲乙丙丁圜其心戊圜内有甲乙丙丁四边形题言甲乙丙丙丁甲两角并乙丙丁丁甲乙两角并各与两直角等论曰试作甲丙乙丁两对角线其甲乙丁甲丙丁两角同负甲乙丙丁圜分即等〈本篇〉〈廿一〉依显丙甲丁丙乙丁两角亦等则甲乙丁丙乙丁两角并为甲乙丙一角与甲丙丁丙甲丁两角并等次每加一丙丁甲角即甲乙丙丙丁甲并与甲丙丁丙甲丁丙丁甲三角并等此三角并元与两直角等〈一卷卅二〉则甲乙丙丙丁甲相对两角并与两直角等依显乙丙丁丁甲乙并亦与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆的内切四边形 说明：对于每一对对角和两个直角，甲乙丙丁 是一个以 戊 为圆心的圆。有一个四边形 甲乙丙丁 四边形命题说明 甲乙丙丙丁甲 两个角加上 乙丙丁丁甲乙 两个角且每个都有两个直角，相等。证明如下：作 甲丙乙丁 两条对角线，甲乙丁甲丙丁 两个角都是负的，甲乙丙丁 弧等于 〈本篇〉〈廿一〉 根据 丙甲丁丙乙丁，两个角也相等，所以 甲乙丁丙乙丁 两角相等。甲乙丙 一个角与 甲丙丁丙甲丁 的和相等。每个额外的 丙丁甲 角等于 甲乙丙丙丁甲 和 甲丙丁丙甲丁丙丁甲。三角形等于两个直角。〈一卷卅二〉 然后 甲乙丙丙丁甲 这两对对角等于两个直角。根据 乙丙丁丁甲乙，两个角等于两个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-22.source","contentId":"euclid-3-22","revisionId":"euclid-3-22@raw-f691c725eff017f8","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3152e90179612914fa815a60ba8ea83bcb50e0319330f9ca396c345a74d10223","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-22:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-22.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-22:euclid-3-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-22.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.22/","sourceLabel":"III. 21"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-31:euclid-3-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-31","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-31.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.p